ship-save-materials-examine = Retains resources in ship saves within per-material limits. In the storage window, a [color=#7ED6AD]green number[/color] means everything will be saved; [color=#EF8D92]red[/color] shows the amount retained when there is excess. Excess resources are not transferred.
ship-save-materials-legend = [color=#7ED6AD]Green — everything retained[/color] · [color=#EF8D92]Red — excess present[/color]
ship-save-materials-column-hint = The colored number beside the stock shows how much the ship save retains.
ship-save-materials-saved-amount = { $amount }
ship-save-materials-saved-tooltip = Retained: { $saved }. Not transferred: { $lost }. Limits apply to each resource type in this silo.
